<title>USA: Petaluma JUHSD, Calif., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Petaluma JUHSD, Calif., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $10.750 million of Petaluma JUHSD, Calif., general obligation bonds, Election of 1992, Series C, with a true interest cost of 5.96 percent.</p>
